---
name: Bull Put Spread
description: Bullish momentum with MACD expansion, suitable for selling bull put spreads
universe: latest_indicators
tags: [bull-put-spread, momentum, macd, bullish]
---
SELECT symbol FROM latest_indicators WHERE macd_hist > 0 AND rsi_14 > 40 AND rsi_14 < 65 ORDER BY macd_hist DESC LIMIT 20
